Commander creator catalog v1 (build20)
MakeHuman base mesh and facial target DATA pinned to a8bc2d54ff0ac92e78ff71431b1023eda42bf482, and selected system hair, eyes, brows, skin textures and Bodyparts05 facial hair assets are CC0. No MakeHuman application code is redistributed.
License: assets/creator/LICENSE-MAKEHUMAN-CC0.md
Per-source SHA256 and ZIP CRC provenance: assets/creator/catalog.json
Sources: https://github.com/makehumancommunity/makehuman ; https://static.makehumancommunity.org/assets/assetpacks/makehuman_system_assets.html ; https://static.makehumancommunity.org/assets/assetpacks/bodyparts05.html
Frontlines authored the wardrobe geometry, materials, runtime editor and conversion pipeline.

Commander23 additions: pinned MakeHuman CC0 DATA supplies64 morphs and subdivided anatomical garment. Creator data license/source hashes remain in assets/creator/catalog.json and LICENSE-MAKEHUMAN-CC0.md. Supplied library admiral plumes, bounded guard/governor head motion and48 commander voice clips retain exact source hashes in accessories23-provenance.json, motions23.json and voices/catalog.json. These supplied legacy game data are not represented as MakeHuman CC0. Library executables were not run.

Commander24 facial performance:28 CC0 faceunit targets pinned to MakeHumanCommunity/extra-targets revision7eaba3453134385bb5ea9811ef0b33b85b4b556d, original fitted teeth/tongue from the existing CC0 system-data source, and one additional Catmull-Clark head subdivision. See assets/creator/face-rig24.json and LICENSE-FACEUNITS-CC0.md. Source data only; no external application code is shipped. Expression choreography and amplitude-only speech timing are authored by Frontlines.


Earth Through Time optional map packs: reconstructed coastline datasets by Merdith et al. (2021) and Muller et al. (2019), through GPlates Web Service, CC BY4.0. Natural Earth I projection, artistic inferred terrain and gameplay subdivisions are Frontlines modifications. Full per-map attribution and dataset receipts are included as SOURCE_CREDITS.md in every optional pack and accessible through Battlefields > Map Credits. Licence https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ ; papers https://doi.org/10.1016/j.earscirev.2020.103477 and https://doi.org/10.1029/2018TC005462 . These maps are stylised reconstructions, not measured ancient terrain.

Commander27 wardrobe: eighteen upper garments and two headwear meshes are adapted from the user's supplied Pirates Rebuilt asset-library data. Original library files, skeletons and animation clips are unmodified. Source model/preview IDs and SHA256 identities are recorded in assets/creator/wardrobe27.json and headwear27.json. These supplied legacy textures/models are not represented as MakeHuman CC0 or as native UHD assets. Mesh refinement, upper-body extraction, source UV preservation, original creator skin-atlas fitting, materials, jewellery and eyewear mounts are Frontlines modifications. No library application code or executable is shipped. Existing CC0 creator skin/anatomy licenses remain in force for those separate components.


Cinzel startup typography: Copyright2012 The Cinzel Project Authors. SIL Open Font License1.1. Font and complete license in assets/startup/Cinzel.ttf and assets/startup/Cinzel-OFL.txt. Source: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/cinzel . Startup battlefield, cannon and smoke artwork generated using image_gen; production prompts and hashes in assets/startup/provenance.json.
